{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22029","main_id":22029,"main_title":"必须精进的武艺","main_description":"一名叫做朝仓的家伙，似乎正在找人帮他锻炼武艺…","chapter_title":"必须精进的武艺","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202901,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":220290120,"next_line_ids":[220290121],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3060,"speaker_text_hash":956022453,"speaker":"朝仓","speaker_raw":"朝仓","text_hash":1444622330,"text":"但是，就在我们刚准备喘口气的时候，从旁边突然又出现了一支海乱鬼，还有一个头领模样的人在率领着他们。","raw_text":"但是，就在我们刚准备喘口气的时候，从旁边突然又出现了一支海乱鬼，还有一个头领模样的人在率领着他们。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22029","main_id":22029,"main_title":"必须精进的武艺","main_description":"一名叫做朝仓的家伙，似乎正在找人帮他锻炼武艺…","chapter_title":"必须精进的武艺","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202901,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":220290121,"next_line_ids":[220290122],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3060,"speaker_text_hash":956022453,"speaker":"朝仓","speaker_raw":"朝仓","text_hash":682850010,"text":"我和其余同僚还没反应过来，就被他们打了个措手不及…","raw_text":"我和其余同僚还没反应过来，就被他们打了个措手不及…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202901.json"}
